    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Once Prince Doran's Blood-Bound ghoul and heir apparent to the chief of police, Carter broke free of his Bond when a mage of the Cult of Ecstasy suppressed it, and turned his hard-won knowledge of the Kindred into a one-man war against them. Doran struck a truce allowing Carter to hunt &ldquo;problem&rdquo; vampires in exchange for restraint; Marcel renewed the arrangement, and Carter has since built the New Orleans Special Task Force (N.O.S.T.F.), 16 hand-picked agents operating inside the N.O.P.D. but answerable only to him. He would purge the city of the Damned entirely if he ever found the means.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>A large, imposing man of few words who treats every conversation as an interrogation.</p>",
    "notes": "A mortal, not a vampire. Carries a silver necklace talisman that warns him of danger. Haven: a home near Lake Pontchartrain. Secrets rating: A.",
